700; color: #d97706; white-space: nowrap;\">⭐ 4.24</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #334155; white-space: nowrap;\">¥3,300〜</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; text-align: center; white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F16170%2F16170.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #d97706; color: #fff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none;\">空室・最安値 ➔</a></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f766e; white-space: nowrap;\">7位</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b;\"><a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F54677%2F54677.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0f766e; text-decoration: underline;\">大歩危温泉　サンリバー大歩危</a></td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #d97706; white-space: nowrap;\">⭐ 4.22</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #334155; white-space: nowrap;\">¥5,500〜</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; text-align: center; white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F54677%2F54677.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #d97706; color: #fff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none;\">空室・最安値 ➔</a></td>\n          </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【徳島県の有名なもの完全ガイド】観光名所・ご当地グルメ・定番お土産・地酒ランキング</h2>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">徳島県の誇る雄大な自然美と歴史ある街並み、名湯温泉、絶品ご当地グルメを満喫できる人気観光ハブ。</p>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50/50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\">🌟 徳島県のハイライト＆名物グルメ</h3>\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900 block mb-1\">📌 主要な観光ハイライト</strong>\n      <p class=\"text-stone-600\">鳴門・祖谷渓温泉名所・徳島県名物・絶景温泉</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900 block mb-1\">🍴 代表的なご当地グルメ</strong>\n      <p class=\"text-stone-600\">徳島県阿波尾鶏・阿波牛・鳴門鯛のしゃぶしゃぶ・徳島ラーメン</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🏯 徳島県で絶対に訪れるべき有名な観光名所</h3>\n<div class=\"space-y-3 my-4\">\n        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">1</span>\n            鳴門の渦潮（大鳴門橋）\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">播磨灘と紀伊水道の干満差によって発生する世界最大級の渦潮。「渦の道」の海上遊歩道ガラス床から見下ろす激しい潮流と渦巻きは大迫力です。</p>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">2</span>\n            祖谷のかずら橋（秘境・祖谷）\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">日本三大秘境・祖谷渓谷に架かるシラクチカズラで作られたスリル満点の吊り橋。一歩踏みだすたびにギシギシと揺れ、足下の隙間から見える吉野川が爽快です。</p>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">3</span>\n            大塚国際美術館\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">世界初の陶板名画美術館。レオナルド・ダ・ヴィンチの『最後の晩餐』やフェルメールの『真珠の耳飾りの少女』など1,000点以上の西洋名画が原寸大で完全再現されています。</p>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">4</span>\n            眉山（びざん）\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">徳島市街の中心に位置し「眉の如く雲居に見ゆる」と万葉集にも詠まれた徳島のシンボル。ロープウェイで登る山頂からは吉野川と徳島平野を一望できます。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🎁 徳島県で喜ばれる人気定番お土産（日持ち・個包装）</h3>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 my-4\">\n        <div class=\"p-3.5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\">\n            <strong class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-900\">🎁 徳島県 伝統銘菓「特製和菓子」</strong>\n            <span class=\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 bg-stone-100 text-stone-600 rounded-md font-semibold\">伝統銘菓</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">徳島県で長年愛される伝統銘菓。しっとりした上品な甘みと職人技が光る極上手土産。</p>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"p-3.5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\">\n            <strong class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-900\">🎁 徳島県 トレンド高級ラングドシャ</strong>\n            <span class=\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 bg-stone-100 text-stone-600 rounded-md font-semibold\">洋菓子・和モダン</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">徳島県産厳選素材をたっぷり使用。サクサク食感ととろけるチョコレートが絶品。</p>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"p-3.5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\">\n            <strong class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-900\">🎁 徳島県 ご当地名産グルメセット</strong>\n            <span class=\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 bg-stone-100 text-stone-600 rounded-md font-semibold\">名産グルメ</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">徳島県の豊かな海・山の恵みをそのまま詰めたご飯のお供＆お酒の最高のアテ。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🍶 徳島県の銘醸酒・日本酒酒蔵ランキング</h3>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 my-4\">\n        <div class=\"p-3.5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\">\n            <strong class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-900\">🍶 徳島県 至高の純米大吟醸</strong>\n            <span class=\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 rounded-md font-semibold\">徳島県名門蔵元</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">徳島県の名水と極上酒米で醸す。フルーティーな吟醸香とキレのある余韻が広がる最高峰。</p>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"p-3.5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\">\n            <strong class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-900\">🍶 徳島県 伝統伝承の特別純米</strong>\n            <span class=\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 rounded-md font-semibold\">徳島県歴史蔵</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">お米本来のふくよかな香りとキレのある後味。徳島県の名物郷土料理と見事に調和する格別の一杯。</p>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"p-3.5 bg-white rou